WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:01.077
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.288 --> 00:00:05.666
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Please take out your laptops...

00:00:06.301 --> 00:00:09.580
All laptops out of cases, please.

00:00:12.499 --> 00:00:13.079
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.373 --> 00:00:18.605
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hi. My name’s Sam Smith.

00:00:19.091 --> 00:00:20.368
I have a reservation.

00:00:20.894 --> 00:00:22.628
<v><b>B:</b></v> Can I see your passport, please?

00:00:22.916 --> 00:00:24.419
<v><b>A:</b></v> Sure, here you are.

00:00:30.242 --> 00:00:30.917
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:35.172 --> 00:00:37.072
<v><b>A:</b></v> Thank you. Goodbye.

00:00:40.825 --> 00:00:43.382
<v><b>B:</b></v> Excuse me, is this your bank card?

00:00:44.117 --> 00:00:45.292
<v><b>A:</b></v> Oh, yes!

00:00:45.698 --> 00:00:47.828
Oh thank you so much!

00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:55.840
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:57.481 --> 00:01:01.660
<v><b>Announcer:</b></v> Please switch off all mobile phones and electronic devices.

00:01:04.634 --> 00:01:05.373
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:01:08.451 --> 00:01:11.011
<v><b>A:</b></v> OK, Ms Jones. Here’s your key.

00:01:11.239 --> 00:01:13.320
You’re in room 315.

00:01:13.518 --> 00:01:14.155
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thanks.

00:01:15.202 --> 00:01:19.267
<v><b>A:</b></v> Carlos, please take Ms Jones to room 315.

00:01:19.669 --> 00:01:20.398
<v><b>C:</b></v> Follow me.